On linux-kernel list Jeff Garzik posted under a subject "[PATCH] alpha
build fixes" a message which says:

<quote>
Needed this to build Fedora rawhide kernel (2.6.12-rc1 + some patches)
on alpha.  This is the upstream portion of the build fixes.
</quote>

The patch is not that big and various interested parties may not
subscribe to linux-kernel; so here it is. It may save some head
scratching.

  Michal
-------------- next part --------------
diff -urN ../kernel-2.6.11.orig/linux-2.6.11/drivers/char/agp/generic.c linux-2.6.11/drivers/char/agp/generic.c
